pan-agent is an add-on for Hermes Agent (https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent),
Copyright (c) 2025 Nous Research, also MIT-licensed. pan-agent does not contain or redistribute
Hermes Agent source code. It is installed into an existing Hermes environment and uses Hermes'
plugin interfaces (the `hermes_agent.memory_providers` entry point and hooks) at runtime. Its tests
import Hermes. PAN was developed in a private fork of Hermes Agent; that fork is not part of this
distribution.

pan-agent is an independent project. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Nous Research.
"Hermes Agent" is used only to describe compatibility.

Runtime dependency: PyYAML (MIT). Test dependency: pytest (MIT).
